<title>USA: Tel Offshore says no quarterly distribution.</title>
<headline>Tel Offshore says no quarterly distribution.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tel Offshore Trust said it had no royalty income for the fourth quarter of 1996 and therefore would not be making a quarterly income distribution.</p>
<p>The lack of royalty income for the fourth quarter of 1996 is due to significant capital expenditures, the company said.</p>
</text>
